## Scenario

Tuff's settings centre. Grouped sections run down the left and groups of setting rows fill the right; every change saves on its own, so the header shows the save status instead of a Save button. Widen it and a live preview appears on the right: change the theme, opacity, result density or result count and a miniature CoreBox follows at once.

It suits desktop preferences, SaaS account and workspace settings, and any configuration page made of many controls that apply as soon as they change.

