### Sectioned settings

:::TuffDemoWrapper{demo="TemplateSettingsDemo" code-lang="vue" title="Sectioned settings" description="Change anything and the header goes from Saving… to Saved; reset, clearing clipboard history and signing out of other devices each ask first. A live preview appears on the right when wide."}
